{"3842090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nomën Ipsa", "steam_appid": 3842090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hardcore, retro-styled action RPG built around demanding boss fights, rendered in chunky pixel art. You learn each boss the hard way: dying to its patterns and phases until you can read every telegraph and punish every opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you actually do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight handcrafted bosses.</strong> Each encounter is mechanically driven: positioning, timing, and reacting to telegraphed attacks matter far more than mashing buttons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind gear and progress your character.</strong> Boss kills feed a loot and equipment progression loop, including rare and unique items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacrifice rare and unique items</strong> to the gods of the Void, trading your hard-won gear for their Favor and lasting power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Renown</strong>: the primary score and currency that anchors the endgame loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the leaderboards</strong>, solo or in up to 4-player co-op.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends (so they can call you useless when you inevitably miss a mechanic), or go solo. Your call, play however you want.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hardcore, retro-styled action RPG built around demanding boss fights, rendered in chunky pixel art. You learn each boss the hard way: dying to its patterns and phases until you can read every telegraph and punish every opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you actually do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight handcrafted bosses.</strong> Each encounter is mechanically driven: positioning, timing, and reacting to telegraphed attacks matter far more than mashing buttons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind gear and progress your character.</strong> Boss kills feed a loot and equipment progression loop, including rare and unique items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacrifice rare and unique items</strong> to the gods of the Void, trading your hard-won gear for their Favor and lasting power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Renown</strong>: the primary score and currency that anchors the endgame loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the leaderboards</strong>, solo or in up to 4-player co-op.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends (so they can call you useless when you inevitably miss a mechanic), or go solo. Your call, play however you want.</p>", "short_description": "Hardcore, retro-styled RPG focused on boss fights with interesting mechanics. Demanding. At times grind-y. There are leaderboards to climb! You can team up with your friends (so they can call you useless when you inevitably miss a mechanic), or go solo. Your call, play however you want.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842090/d5e7761081db2213edd6d2f3bc34de388d85c5f1/header.jpg?t=1788262865", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842090/62183b58987cff47080cd4e1dd910fef7477f5b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788262865", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842090/62183b58987cff47080cd4e1dd910fef7477f5b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788262865", "website": "https://nomenipsa.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available spa